# Rikkei Jobs mock - goi thu bang IntelliJ (mui ten xanh) hoac VS Code + REST Client (Send Request)
# Truoc khi chay: cd mock && npm start  (mock o http://localhost:9000)

### Ca 1 - Khong co khoa -> 401 INVALID_SERVICE_KEY
GET http://localhost:9000/lms/courses

### Ca 2 - Sai khoa -> 401 INVALID_SERVICE_KEY
GET http://localhost:9000/lms/courses
X-Service-Key: sai-key

### Ca 3 - Cap ve cho candidate1 -> 201 {ticket, issuedAt}
POST http://localhost:9000/lms/sso/tickets
X-Service-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"lmsUserId": "lms-sv-001"}

### Ca 4 - Doi ve lay thong tin -> 200 Nguyen Van An, CANDIDATE
# Dan gia tri "ticket" nhan duoc o Ca 3 vao body duoi day
POST http://localhost:9000/lms/sso/verify
X-Service-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket": "47f1357fcaaa8aa1c445985c7994a35b"}

### Ca 5 - Chay lai dung Ca 4 voi cung ve -> van 200 (mock khong chan ve cu, backend tu chan)

### Ca 6 - Ve bia -> 404 NOT_FOUND
POST http://localhost:9000/lms/sso/verify
X-Service-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket": "abc123"}

### Ca 7 - User khong ton tai -> 404 NOT_FOUND
POST http://localhost:9000/lms/sso/tickets
X-Service-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"lmsUserId": "lms-sv-999"}

### Ca 8 - Co khoa nhung sai duong dan -> 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:9000/lms/abc
X-Service-Key: dev-key

### Ca 9 - Nhat ky request (khong can khoa) -> 200, kiem hasKey
GET http://localhost:9000/mock/requests

### Ca 10 - Nap lai data.json (khong can khoa) -> 200 {"ok": true}
# Sua fullName cua lms-sv-001 trong data.json, goi request nay, roi chay lai Ca 3 + Ca 4 de thay ten moi
POST http://localhost:9000/mock/reload

### Ca 11 - Body JSON hong -> 400 INVALID_JSON
POST http://localhost:9000/lms/sso/verify
X-Service-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket": 
